source_item.description:
Schema for a single source item in the sources list. This is not a top-level variable but defines the structure for items in 'sources'.
Note: In standard gonja/json schema, list items are often defined via a separate map or just inline. Here we define the properties as flat fields if supported, but standard json schema for list items requires 'items' property. To adhere to the 'FLAT map field-name' instruction for items, we provide the schema for the keys inside the list item object.
Fields for source_item:
- name: {type: string, default: '', description: 'Source name'}
- url: {type: string, default: '', description: 'Source URL'}
